      <LongDescription>The &lt;noparse&gt;SGM-200 补刀&lt;/noparse&gt; is a size 2 direct guidance missile.  It is based on the SGM-2 body, which is a flexible mainstay anti-ship missile.  This missile will deliver a Contact Fuze, High Explosive, Shaped warhead.  It homes in on its target using an Active Radar seeker, validating that it is the correct target using a Passive Wake seeker.

